# MongoDB Atlas Configuration
# 1. In your MongoDB Atlas Dashboard, click 'Connect' -> 'Drivers' (Python)
# 2. Copy the connection string and paste it below (replace <db_password> with your database user password):
# MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<db_password>@cluster0.abcde.mongodb.net/plantcare_db?retryWrites=true&w=majority

